gasR(){return"Select Multiple Cells"},
gasQ(){return"Need the same shift across several people or days? Drag across the grid \u2014 or long-press then tap \u2014 to select many cells, then assign them all at once from the bar that appears."},
gasZ(){return"Reusable Templates"},
gasY(){return"In the shift editor, tick 'Save as template' and give it a name to store a shift you use often. Next time it appears as a chip you can apply in one tap."},
