gb2I(){return"In Colleagues view you draft your own row. 'Copy last week' fills your empty days from last week, and the amber hint reminds you that your manager publishes your final schedule."},
gasV(){return"Draft Your Own Shifts"},
gasU(){return"Tap an empty day on your row to propose a shift, or tap your own draft to edit it. Days your manager has reserved show a lock and can't be edited. Your drafts stay pending until your manager publishes them."},
gaaC(){return"Request a Swap"},
gaaB(){return"Tap a colleague's shift to request a swap with them. You can only swap future shifts, and not when either of you is on leave or already has an open request for that day."},
gb2H(){return"Manager Comparison Row"},
gb2G(){return"This pinned row shows your manager's schedule for reference (read-only, marked with a 'Manager' badge) so you can line your own shifts up against theirs."},
gb2F(){return"Pick a Week"},
gb2E(){return"Tap the arrows to move between weeks; the label in the middle shows the week you're viewing."},
gb2z(){return"Week at a Glance"},
gb2y(){return"Quick totals for the week: people scheduled and shifts always show; in Team view you also see conflicts and unpublished drafts."},
gb2v(){return"Choose a Day"},
